flowchart TD
    A[Service booking] --> B[Create ServiceDeposit with purpose]
    B --> C[Receive deposit via PaymentTransaction: DEPOSIT_RECEIPT]
    C --> D{Deposit purpose / disposition}
    D -->|Parts preorder or booking advance| E[Hold as customer deposit]
    D -->|Security| F[Hold separately as security]
    E --> G{Apply to service invoice?}
    F --> H{Refund or validly forfeit?}
    G -->|Yes| I[DepositApplication: non-cash order credit]
    G -->|No| E
    H -->|Refund| J[DEPOSIT_REFUND transaction]
    H -->|Forfeit with approval| K[Deposit event: FORFEITED]
    H -->|Continue holding| F
